The GNU Atomic Library implements atomic operations that the target cannot
perform directly, including generic-sized C and C++ atomic objects. This
package builds only libatomic from the same GCC 16.2.0 source as the common
EmberBSD compiler. It does not install compiler frontends or older runtimes.

Use this component only for an incomplete cross SDK. Full gcc16 and gcc16-libs
packages already provide libatomic and conflict with this package.
